# Build context for docker/stand/Dockerfile (Dockerfile-scoped ignore file).
# Keep secrets (any .env at any depth, the rendered relay config), VCS data, local graph outputs and the untracked reference
# checkouts out of the image entirely.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.envrc
!**/.env.example
docker/relay/iroh-relay.toml
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude
.beads
.beads*
.dsh-build
.artifacts
.playwright-mcp
coverage
graphify-out
graphify-out.bak-*
references
*.tsbuildinfo
website/.dist
website/.generated
node_modules
**/node_modules
